            "text": "Session Management Issue found\n\nThe contract's state is dependant on the user's session (tokenBalance), but there is no session timeout set.\n\nImpact: Account takeover and unauthorized access to user accounts\n\nRemediation: Implement proper timeout settings for user sessions"
          },
